{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_02_beg","storyGroup":"act42side","storySort":4,"storyDependence":"act42side_level_act42side_01_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"MT-2","storyName":"祈祷","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"拉特兰颁行了严格的武装管控政策，所有铳械工坊都将被关停，而四处寻找爆炸物材料的能天使正好来到一家铳械工坊寻求帮助。育婴圣堂则在大规模接收不同种族、不同国籍的难民。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act42side/level_act42side_02_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act42side_02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":2,"next":4,"characters":["阿摩斯","大眼睛","潘格尼尼","能天使","鲁珀","库兰塔","菲林","忙碌的修女","？？？","？？","添头","牧首","能天使&梵里妮","梵里妮","倔强的小孩","骄傲的小孩","安多恩","薇尔丽芙"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":7},{"type":"text","text":"法柏尔区，博尔戈街，铳械工坊","id":8},{"type":"dialog","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":11},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":12},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":13,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1.5","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"......你好，有人吗？","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":17},{"type":"charslot","id":18},{"type":"text","text":"这间工坊不大，充当货架的圣徒像随意陈列，它们以各种匪夷所思的姿势向客人展示着铳械......","id":19},{"type":"text","text":"但阿摩斯并未看到一个客人，他一路走来，除了自己，并没有什么人在工坊的门前停留。“冷清”——这是阿摩斯的第一感受。","id":20},{"type":"text","text":"也不至于连老板都不见踪影吧，他看着昏暗的灯光打在那些圣徒像上，心想。“诡异”——这是阿摩斯的第二感受。","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"200,0","focus":"l","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"潘格尼尼先生在吗？","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#10$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"200,0","focus":"l","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"（说真的，为什么铳械工坊的老板要叫这样滑稽的名字......）","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"220,0","duration":"1.5","focus":"l","id":27},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":29},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"1","id":30},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":32},{"type":"text","text":"阿摩斯四处打量，突然撞到了什么。","id":33},{"type":"dialog","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":35},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_bg_61_g12_firearmsworkshop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1.5","id":36},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":37},{"type":"text","text":"他猛然回头，对上了一双硕大而透亮的眼睛，那眼睛隐在阴影里，直勾勾地盯着他。","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大眼睛","text":"......","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#4$1","posfrom":"220,0","posto":"220,0","focus":"l","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"救......","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":43},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大眼睛","text":"*拉特兰俚语*你谁啊乱闯我的地盘——等我戴个眼镜！","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"220,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":50},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":52},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":53,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大眼睛","text":"公务员？","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大眼睛","text":"对不住啊，最近也没生意，躲在里面睡觉，没想到会有公务员先生大驾光临。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"枢机辅佐官阿摩斯，来确认这间铳械工坊的接收事宜。您就是......","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"我就是名字很滑稽的潘格尼尼。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"......","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"等等，黎博利？","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"难不成我看起来像萨科塔？","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"啊抱歉，我的意思是，我没见过黎博利从事这个职业。毕竟，守护铳只有萨科塔——","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"有什么问题？","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"很多厨子都不吃自己做的菜，我只是没法使用自己造的武器罢了。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"你要检查我的铳械制造资质证明吗？放眼整个拉特兰，出自我手的守护铳没有一千也有八百，说不定你手上的这把......","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"——","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"啧啧，一看做工就很“顶级”，我倒是没这样的手艺。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"......","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"不过如今都没什么所谓了，反正这里就要关停了。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"近期所有的订单都已经退掉了，店里新完工的这一批铳，到时候让公证所的人直接带走吧。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"原、原来您已经做好了准备。我本以为......","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"会很麻烦？我这个人会很难搞？","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"我、我不是这个意思。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"注册资料显示，这间铳械工坊已有百年历史。身为黎博利，您却选择为萨科塔造守护铳，这里对您来说一定意义非凡——","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"行了行了。这几年来谁都知道铳械工坊要成为历史了，大家都只是在等那个时候到来。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"你问我愿不愿意，我当然不愿意。需要我把最近这段时间彻夜难眠的煎熬过程倾诉给你听吗？","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"如果您需要倾诉，我可以帮您拦一辆告解车，告解费由七厅承担。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"那恐怕还是你更需要告解。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"我已经是个要退休的老头了，但梵里妮，我的学徒，她甚至还没来得及亲手为自己做一把守护铳。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"既然铳械工坊将不复存在，你们得负责那孩子后续的发展。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"当然，铳械工坊的关停，只是为了让铳械生产的流程变得更正规、更高效。像您与您的学徒这样的铳械工匠，仍是宝贵的人才。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"我会向负责民政的第六厅汇报。您的学徒——梵里妮小姐，应当会被推荐到米迦莱昂区即将落成的制铳圣堂工作。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"“制铳圣堂”......啧。但愿他们开工制铳的那天，还能像起这个名字的时候那么自信。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"我当然相信拉特兰的......","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"行了行了，这种鬼话我听得够多了。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"......那么，如果没有别的问题，请您在关停文件上签字吧，潘格尼尼先生。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"即时起，此铳械工坊的所有业务都将终止，后续会由中庭公证所跟进具体的接收事宜。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"1.5","focus":"r","id":110},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":111},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_writerub","volume":"1","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","focus":"r","id":114},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"那么，再见。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"不送。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":121},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","isblock":"false","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1.5","id":124},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":125},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":126},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"charslot","id":129},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_bg_26_g9_laterano_street.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":130},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":131},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":133},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#1$5","duration":"1.5","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"法柏尔区，博尔戈街......真是熟悉啊。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-1$5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#9$5","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"哈，就是这里！","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-9$5.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#1$1","posfrom":"800,0","posto":"800,0","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":142},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"600,0","duration":"5.5","isblock":"false","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"800,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"6","isblock":"false","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":146},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#7$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"-100,0","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"......","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":153},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":154},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":155},{"type":"charslot","id":156},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_bg_39_g1_monasteryentrance.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":157},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":158},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":159,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁珀","text":"终于完成接驳了？","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_001","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"应、应该吧。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"在外围等了两天，我想赶紧出去透口气！","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菲林","text":"真是的，是这帮拉特兰人在我们流浪的时候邀请我们登上了这座移动修道院，结果到了拉特兰又让我们干等。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":169},{"type":"charslot","id":170},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.4","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_369_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"让各位久等了，非常抱歉。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_369_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"在此之前，已经有十二座移动修道院陆续抵达了拉特兰，加上万国峰会期间事务繁多，希望各位理解。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_369_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"公证所已在安布罗修区准备了短期的安置住宅，等到各位安顿下来，第六厅将协助各位办理户籍和社会福利事宜。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_369_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁珀","text":"等、等等，修女，没理解错的话，我们这些外族人以后可以在拉特兰常住？","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_369_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"以第二届万国峰会为契机，拉特兰将向所有种族敞开怀抱......","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_369_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"这里也将成为“你们的城市”。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_369_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"charslot","id":183},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"0.4","loop":"true","channel":"1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"喂喂，添头，你还好吗？","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我让他们去找医生！","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？","text":"别去！","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？","text":"暂时别让那帮萨科塔发现......","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_369_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"请让我过去。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_369_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_001","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"修女，不用了。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菲林","text":"我们能处理，你刚刚不是说还有很多事情要忙吗？","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":195},{"type":"charslot","id":196},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"1","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#4$1","duration":"1.5","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"嘶——","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_369_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"萨卡兹......你怀孕了？","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_369_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"你们的人邀请大家伙进修道院的时候可没拦着萨卡兹，怎么，现在又想拿出来说事？","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"我可以马上走，我不稀罕萨科塔的帮助！","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"所以你们也别想对付我和我的孩子！","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_369_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"......","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_369_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"charslot","id":211},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"各位误会了，只是修道院的常规对接事务中并不包含如何安置一位怀孕的母亲，安吉修女一下子没有反应过来。","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"安吉修女，请允许我将她带回育婴圣堂。","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_369_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"阁下，育婴圣堂还未正式对外开放，这不符合规定。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_369_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"以及，您怎么在这里？","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_369_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"charslot","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":221},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_avg_dreamrite_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_dreamrite_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":222,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"主遣我至应至之地。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"规定只是死物。育婴圣堂不可能无视一位病重的母亲。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_369_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"我明白了。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_369_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"......","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"女士，我叫歧法，拉特兰育婴圣堂的牧首，唔，也就是负责人。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"none","id":232},{"type":"text","text":"金发女性缓缓转向萨卡兹，她的声音很轻柔，但是又足够清晰，像是在小心翼翼地试探着什么。","id":233},{"type":"text","text":"萨卡兹的视线划过她头顶那两对漆黑的尖角，落在她的眼睛上。透过眼罩繁复的雕纹，她看到了一片虚无。","id":234},{"type":"dialog","id":235},{"type":"charslot","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"你是什么......萨卡兹，还是萨科塔？而且还是个瞎子？","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"萨卡兹、萨科塔，这些词语本不必被用于强调区别。我与你何其相似......我也同你一样，在抚育着我所珍视的生命。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"所以，目盲并不妨碍我感受你和你腹中的新生命......他给你带来了怎样的紧张与喜悦啊。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"我们萨卡兹从来不这么说话。所以你是萨科塔，是个有孩子的奇怪萨科塔。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"你就是在刚刚说的那个育什么堂，抚育你的孩子的？那到底是什么地方？","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"“育婴圣堂”，你我此刻正站在它的荫蔽之中。新生命在那里诞下，得到抚育。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"一座“圣堂”......专门用来生孩子？","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"新生是神圣的。每一次新生，都是对拉特兰信仰的延续。唯有如此，我们才得以塑造未来的形貌。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"听不懂。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"女士，你一直在荒野上流浪，孕期没有得到应有的照顾，你现在非常虚弱......他也是。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"你确定要在这时候离开近在咫尺的圣城，重回荒野？","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"我......","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"......","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"女士，你的名字叫“添头”？","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"不好听？","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"我们知晓萨卡兹的困顿与艰难......许多萨卡兹母亲会随口给孩子起名“添头”，只把孩子视作自己生活中的一个小小的添头。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"这名字跟我妈没关系，是我怀了这孩子之后，自己起的。谁能说清我和这孩子，到底谁是谁的添头？","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"啊......","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"有什么问题吗？","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"......你很看重自己与这个孩子的联系。你骄傲地希望让所有人都知道，你的生活里多出了这样一个小小的添头。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"女士，这样伟大的情感，无关乎种族与仇恨。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"......","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"我明白你在担心什么。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"此刻，这座修道院中的所有人——萨科塔、菲林、库兰塔、鲁珀、沃尔珀......所有人都是你我的见证。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"请放心，现在是万国峰会期间，无数异族的来客齐聚拉特兰，拉特兰还不至于在所有人都知情的情况下对一个怀孕的母亲做什么。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_418_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菲林","text":"......","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_418_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_001","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"库兰塔","text":"（点头）","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_001.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_696_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"鲁珀","text":"（传递眼神）","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_696_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_369_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"......","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_369_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"我向你保证。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1807_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"添头","text":"那好吧。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_1807_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1777_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"感谢你的理解，女士。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"让我们共同迎接这个新生命在拉特兰降生，它将跨越隔阂，被赋予全新的意义，这次孕育将成为一次壮举。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"我为此而来......主遣我至应至之地。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"牧首","text":"最后，欢迎来到拉特兰......如今的拉特兰需要各位。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1777_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":299},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":300},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":301},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_bg_61_g12_firearmsworkshop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":303},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":304},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_comedy_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":305,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"......","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"反正我帮不了你。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"哎呀，我还什么都没说呢！","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"那请问，这位萨科塔小姐，你是要维修守护铳还是要定制弹药？","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"出门往左，如果你的动作比那些公务员快，米迦莱昂区或许还剩下三四家铳械工坊没有被关停。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"十分钟前，我已经在第七厅的接收文书上签了字，现在经手任何相关的事情都等于触犯律法......","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"如果我说我想搞一场轰动全城的大爆炸呢？","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"没兴趣。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"拜托，你可是“铳械工坊之王”潘大师！谁都能对爆炸不感兴趣，但那也不能是你啊！","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"......不要拿你刚编的称号来恭维我。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"潘大师，我知道你的难处啦。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"我也只是想请你帮点小忙而已——比如说借借你这里的设备，或者你的专业知识——帮我理解一下拉特兰现在的情况。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"毕竟我真的很着急。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"我的老板说，无论发生什么都不能阻碍企鹅物流完成任务然后办派对！","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"呃......","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"不需要您亲手做任何事情，这样就不算触犯律法了，对吧？","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"把你的守护铳从我的收藏上移开，萨科塔小姐。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"尤其是，这把铳还*拉特兰俚语*是我亲手做的——","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"哈哈，你认出来了啊。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"那你一定知道它的威力有多大吧！","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"none","id":344},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":345},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"老师，我找保拉医生帮你重新配了一副眼镜！她数落了我好久，说你要是再接着戴之前那副古董眼镜，那简直就是自虐......","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"快换上试试看吧。呃——","id":348},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"charslot","id":350},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1779_1#3$2","duration":"1.5","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"老师，这是怎么回事？！这个人是？","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_npc_1779_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"charslot","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1779_1#3$2","focus":"l","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"呀——这不是当初那个不太会说话的小姑娘嘛！什么时候说话这么利索啦！","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"你叫什么来着，梵莉姆，梵妮斯，还是梵——","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1779_1#11$2","focus":"all","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使&梵里妮","text":"——梵里妮！","id":362},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"你看，我们的默契还在的嘛！","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1779_1#6$2","focus":"r","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梵里妮","text":"啊......我想起来了，小乐姐！你当时来工坊选自己的第一把守护铳......","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_1779_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梵里妮","text":"每次店里来客，老师都不让我出去打扰客人......可是那天外面动静真的很大，我实在忍不住好奇......","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_1779_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梵里妮","text":"结果还是被老师发现了。我一直在害怕挨骂，其他的事情都记不太清了......对不起，小乐姐！","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_1779_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"是这样吗？你当时在害怕吗......？","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1779_1#4$2","focus":"r","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梵里妮","text":"（点头）","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_1779_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"奇怪，我以为你当时很开心的。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1779_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梵里妮","text":"对了，小乐姐，你今天来工坊，是为了？","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_1779_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"（眨眼睛）","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":379},{"type":"charslot","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"梵妮。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"刚刚第七厅的人来过了，这间工坊已经......","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":384},{"type":"charslot","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1779_1#11$2","focus":"r","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梵里妮","text":"我还没有成为正式的制铳师，不算这间工坊的员工，应该不算触犯律法吧。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1779_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":389},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":390},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":391},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1779_1#11$2","focus":"r","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梵里妮","text":"老师，让我来接待这位客人可以吗？","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1779_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":395},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":396},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":397},{"type":"charslot","id":398},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_bg_61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":399},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":400},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":401,"musicid":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":402},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":403},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1802_1#1$2","duration":"1.5","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1801_1#1$2","duration":"1.5","id":405},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1801_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小孩","text":"保育员先生，抓到你了！","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1801_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1802_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"骄傲的小孩","text":"你跑到哪里去了呀，洛米雅说你在躲着我们，是真的吗？","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1802_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":411},{"type":"charslot","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"......","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"怎么会呢。","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":417},{"type":"charslot","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1802_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":419},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1801_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倔强的小孩","text":"那我们一起去玩“光环游戏”！","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1801_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1802_1#1$2","focus":"none","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"今天由我来陪你们玩吧，安多恩叔叔还有事要做。","id":424},{"type":"dialog","id":425},{"type":"charslot","id":426},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":427},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":428},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":429},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"薇尔丽芙阁下。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"我只是有些私事需要处理，很快就会回来。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"别紧张，你的暂离申请已经同步给我了。倒是你自己，明明请了假，却还在这里陪孩子们玩？","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"......只是一场“光环游戏”的话，应该不会耽误。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"然后呢？你觉得孩子们会乖乖放你走？","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"......我会想办法。","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"我听到的说法是，你从来没办法拒绝孩子们。","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"因勤恳与虔诚而被牧首看重，并由她亲手培养起来的第一位保育员......曾经居然是违背律法的罪犯。谁能想到呢？","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"薇尔丽芙阁下，我确实只是去参加一个朋友的家庭聚会，我们许久未见。","id":446,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9d/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"都说了不用紧张，我并不担心你在吹气球或者烤蛋糕的时候会把拉特兰炸掉。","id":448,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"我只是好奇，为什么牧首眼中的你，与教皇厅记录中的你，像是两个截然不同的人？","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"......牧首从未忽视或否认我的罪行，薇尔丽芙阁下。她只是更看重我对她的理解。","id":451,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9d/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"那时她还不是牧首，我只是在一座废弃的移动修道院躲避天灾时，恰巧与她相遇。","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"牧首眼盲，听觉却非常敏锐。在源石浪潮冲击远方山脉的轰响之中，她听到了从地下室传来的一声哀哭。","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"一位母亲，满身血污地蜷缩在阴影中，奄奄一息。她试图威吓牧首，保护自己的孩子，却只能做出痛苦的表情。","id":456,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"你和牧首最初带来圣城的那位母亲？她的伤是最有医德的医生也会放弃抢救的程度。","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"你们是如何判断出她能活下来的？","id":459,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"我没有......我起初甚至不相信她能活过那个晚上。但牧首相信奇迹，仿佛那是天经地义之事。","id":461,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"牧首想要让我也相信，相信那位可怜的母亲能因我们而得救。","id":463,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"她得救了，薇尔丽芙阁下......一开始，我对医疗护理的工作并不擅长，只好尽我所能地感受她、陪伴她、照顾她。","id":465,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"你们在一座搁浅荒野的修道院里滞留了三个月，就为了一个“奇迹”？","id":467,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"......因为拉特兰需要一个奇迹。","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9d/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"那你们还真是比我印象中要理性得多，或许我该对你们都刮目相看。","id":471,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1800_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安多恩","text":"......如果这样有助于教皇厅支持育婴圣堂的工作的话。","id":473,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_npc_1800_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1780_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":474},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"理性到有点无聊了。","id":475,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"薇尔丽芙","text":"快去快回吧，安多恩保育员，至少我还希望看到降生仪式顺利举行。","id":476,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1780_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":477},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":478},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":479},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":480},{"type":"image","id":481},{"type":"charslot","id":482}],"characters":["阿摩斯","大眼睛","潘格尼尼","能天使","鲁珀","库兰塔","菲林","忙碌的修女","？？？","？？","添头","牧首","能天使&梵里妮","梵里妮","倔强的小孩","骄傲的小孩","安多恩","薇尔丽芙"]}